Subject: [PATCH] Prove current backhaul reaches the native controller before admitting children

Use a bounded RDK vendor-specific 1905 nonce roundtrip on the existing native
backhaul transport. Bind replies to controller, agent, STA, parent and HAL
association generation before asking OneWifi to open downstream backhaul BSSs.
This is native admission, not a host-side BSSID override or a steering timeout
change. Both native controller and agent must implement this extension.

